      "chunk_text_excerpt": "Until recently, most people who discussed AI were talking about predictive AI. This type of artificial intelligence focuses on looking at an existing set of data and making limited predictions about what should be true given the information at hand. Now there\u2019s a new player on the field\u2014an emerging type of AI that\u2019s generative, not predictive. The key difference? Where predictive AI analyzes trends, generative AI creates new content.",
